                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was an honor to join @GEICO, the National @AutoBodyCouncil, and @FriendshipPlace to help a local veteran get back on the road. Joseph Butler of Laurel received a refurbished \u201cRecycled Ride\u201d that will help him get to work and access his medication. Now, he\u2019s already paying it forward by volunteering to help others. That\u2019s the power of community and compassion in action. Thank you to GEICO, Enterprise Mobility, and @CaliberAutoBody for making it possible.",
