                "text": "Millions of working families \u2014 especially in communities of color \u2014 are facing higher health care costs because Republicans are holding the government hostage to fund tax breaks for billionaires.\n\nI joined my colleagues, @ProtectOurCare and advocates nationwide to demand action and stop this #GOPHealthCareCrisis.\nHealth care is a right \u2014 not a privilege. Congress must act now to protect affordable coverage for all.\n#ProtectOurCare #ACA #HealthCareForAll",
