                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I will continue fighting to protect the future of the Beltsville Agricultural Research Center because people across the country made their voices clear: 92% of comments told USDA that reorganizing BARC would put essential research, pollinator health, and agricultural innovation at risk. More than 2,000 public comments urging USDA to protect this key facility clearly demonstrate that agricultural communities across America know what's at stake.\n\nI am proud to stand alongside thousands of agricultural stakeholders from a variety of sub-sectors, committed to making sure BARC's decades of knowledge and expertise stay in Beltsville where they belong.\n\nhttps://t.co/M0GTWg9cK1",
